5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Hello everyone. To make a thoughtful choice, I think it would be wise to look at the weather days in the site diaries and the survey findings in the older blocks.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'll go with the booking data for specialist and general rooms and the timetable records on rooms out of service! I want to see how the spaces are actually used.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I believe it is important to consider the human element. I will look into the staffing posts since the hiring freeze and the bench technicians' weekly manual routines.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I will examine the post-occupancy review ratings and the decade of delivery schedules by project rationale to see which types of projects actually succeeded.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I shall opt for the tender records over three budget cycles and the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier. It would be prudent to see if our financial projections align with reality.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It seems we have a very comprehensive list covered. Does anyone feel we have missed a critical perspective, or are we satisfied with these selections?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I think we've got it all covered! Everyone is looking into something different, so we'll have a great variety of information to talk about.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I agree. There is no need to overlap our efforts when the current distribution is so thorough.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree as well. Since we have divided the available data so efficiently, we can proceed to the findings without any gaps in our knowledge.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. It is a rare pleasure to see such seamless coordination on the first attempt. I believe we are quite ready to move forward.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"Since we are all in agreement, I shall simply wait for the results of our research. I look forward to hearing what you all discover.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,Me too! I'm really curious to see if the booking data shows what I suspect. I'll be waiting patiently!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I shall do the same. It will be interesting to see if the staffing records reflect the pressures I suspect the team is facing.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will also wait. I am particularly interested to see if the delivery schedules reveal a pattern in why certain projects slip.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall likewise remain in anticipation. I suspect the financial records may hold some rather illuminating discrepancies that will ground our subsequent deliberations.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
